    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Out of Skull is a puzzle platformer built around \u201chead- throwing\u201d action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A skeleton living in the underworld embarks on a dangerous adventure to escape to the above ground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your \u201chead\u201d to solve the puzzles and escape the underworld!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Throw the head, hit the body and revive!</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554230/extras/6ad68c6d6248ed13b42e9f9607eff5e7.poster.avif?t=1755666069\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554230/extras/6ad68c6d6248ed13b42e9f9607eff5e7.webm?t=1755666069\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554230/extras/6ad68c6d6248ed13b42e9f9607eff5e7.mp4?t=1755666069\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find out the various uses of head tossing!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554230/extras/7a6c307665751a4fa3eae5100c51bd37.poster.avif?t=1755666069\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554230/extras/7a6c307665751a4fa3eae5100c51bd37.webm?t=1755666069\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554230/extras/7a6c307665751a4fa3eae5100c51bd37.mp4?t=1755666069\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find the door in the stage and explore the underworld!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" a